ays, they paid me $40. So that was a lot of money in those days. If my rent was $38-- I mean our rent. So my one week's pay paid for the rent. But I gave everything home to my parents, except I took like $3 or something spending money or something. And the rest, we all worked together. We-- you know. And then I started dating. When I was 17 was the first date. When I was 17, I had my first date. The neighbor saw me, and he liked me. And he went to my father and asked him, can I take your daughter out? It was a New Year's Eve. And my father said, yes, you can. So he took me out. It was my first date.

